# Requests for the VS Code REST Client extension or Visual Studio / Rider .http support.
@base = http://localhost:5082

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create an expense
POST {{base}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Groceries", "amount": 42.50, "category": "Food", "spentOn": "2026-09-03" }

### List (filters and paging are optional)
GET {{base}}/api/expenses?category=food&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30&page=1&pageSize=20

### Get one
GET {{base}}/api/expenses/1

### Update
PUT {{base}}/api/expenses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Groceries (weekly)", "amount": 55.00, "category": "food", "spentOn": "2026-09-03" }

### Monthly summary (defaults to the current month)
GET {{base}}/api/expenses/summary

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/expenses/1
